Value POWER_ID (\d+)
Value MODEL (\S+)
Value STATUS (ok|fail|absent|\S+)
Value ATTRIBUTE (\S+)
Value COEXIST (\S+)
Value HARDWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value SERIAL_NUMBER (\S+)
Value SUPPLY_WATT (\d+)
Value EXCEPTION (\S+)

Start
  ^Power-id\s+Power-type\s+Status
  ^-+
  ^${POWER_ID}\s+${MODEL}\s+${STATUS}\s+${ATTRIBUTE}\s+${COEXIST}\s+${HARDWARE_VERSION}\s+${SERIAL_NUMBER}\s+${SUPPLY_WATT}\s+${EXCEPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
